{"ID":"20230927152043-71qciir","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230927152043-71qciir","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927152043-71qciir\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927152046-2kxeiwg\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927152046-ks2auym\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927152046-ks2auym\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:19,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:19\u0026#125;","title":"【逍遥散】","type":"doc","updated":"20230927152046"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230927152046-2kxeiwg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927152046-2kxeiwg","updated":"20230927152046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一个逍遥散证的人，可能会因为气不能动乃至于他的血不能动。因为血不能到该去的地方，或者每天血都塞在头部，脸红，好像血行不通畅，或者每个月月经来时都会有血块，不舒服；（气郁造成的血郁）"}]},{"ID":"20230927152046-k3801io","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927152046-k3801io","updated":"20230927152046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"逍遥散该方做了一个很好的示范，就是它是在中国历代疏肝方中一个，所谓在最中间的中间轴上的一个最大公约数正确的疏肝方；所以，后代很多疏肝的药，大概都是以不背叛这个逍遥散这个中间轴为原则开始开拓的。"}]},{"ID":"20230927152046-2j96uvv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927152046-2j96uvv","updated":"20230927152046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"加味逍遥散：加味栀子和牡丹皮；"}]},{"ID":"20230927152046-iw5nx6m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927152046-iw5nx6m","updated":"20230927152046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果用阴阳来分类，同样是肝的血分病，我们会比较把逍遥散称之为肝阳虚，然后加味逍遥散治的叫做肝阴虚；"}]},{"ID":"20230927152046-ks2auym","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927152046-ks2auym","updated":"20230927152046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"适用：生闷气后不适；工作压力大；熬夜；"}]}]}